The claim is explicitly and clearly refuted. The Food Act 2014 does not ban gardening; in fact, it carves out an explicit exemption for plant materials intended for planting. The bill was also not "new" as of October 2020, having been enacted six years earlier. The claim has been thoroughly debunked as a hoax by numerous credible sources.

